    <title>Ep2 . 特别篇 | 新婚夫妇的2024年度复盘大会(上)，点击参会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676dbec715a5fd520ee2af7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676dbec715a5fd520ee2af7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Dec 2024 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年作为我们的婚姻元年，意义非凡。定期的双人小会是我们夫妻自恋爱以来一直践行的优良传统，这个岁末，我们将它升级成了一次年度复盘大会。一起正视过去一年的各项成长、发展，聊聊感受、感情，然后再分享各自和共同对2025年的希望、祝福，立下flag，共创新生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里是会议的上半部分，点击入会，开麦请举手！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2024年复盘大会议程</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 个人成长 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>个人职业发展</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>学习新技能或爱好</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>健康和健身目标</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>2. 关系发展 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>作为新婚夫妇的体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>共同克服的挑战</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>一起实现的目标</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>3. 旅行和探险 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>去过的地方和旅行故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>最难忘的旅行经历</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>4. 家庭和家居 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3133">52:13</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>家居装饰和改造</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>家庭传统和节日庆祝</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>5. 财务状况 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3334">55:34</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>理财和投资</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>预算和消费习惯的改变</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>6. 社会和文化 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3847">64:07</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>影响你们的重要新闻事件</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>参与的社会活动或志愿服务</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>7. 娱乐和休闲 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3940">65:40</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看过的电影、书籍、音乐会</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>尝试的新运动或游戏</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>8. 健康与福祉 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4082">68:02</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>健康习惯的改变</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>心理健康和自我关怀</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>还有下集哦，我们会聊聊新一年的策略和计划，哈哈~</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎关注订阅，探讨交流！</span></p>]]></description>
